 "_source": "FMC 10.0.1 (2026-10-21, F82 #276 last scope item on the ftd-tls-cipher-policy lab, Global/mcp-test-leaf): decryption policy tls-cipher-dec's rules (GET ?expanded=true; FMC lists them in creation order) and its cipher suite lists before the run (rules_before: block-weak-ciphers on tls-weak-no-rc4), then after each fmc_update_decryption_rule: block-weak-ciphers switched to tls-weak-preset (rules_preset; FMC answered the PUT 200 with the rule as sent), moved with insert_before=1 (rules_moved_up; PUT ?insertBefore=1 answered put_500 but moved it) and back with insert_before=3 (rules_moved_down; PUT ?insertAfter=2, the same 500), block-old-tls disabled and unlogged (rules_disabled), re-enabled and logged, and block-weak-ciphers back on tls-weak-no-rc4 (rules_final); tls-weak-preset by id (GET object/ciphersuitelists/{id}; FMC's DELETE answered the same body) and the lists after fmc_delete_object removed it (lists_final). The usage API's answer for a cipher suite list (usage_400). Ids replaced with the placeholders of decryption_tls_conditions_fmc10.json, the leaf domain with the unit tests' login domain.",
